#ASSERT NOT `the partner is personally liable for the debt under section 28` `a debt at 30 months, unknown`
#ASSERT NOT `the partner is personally liable for the debt under section 28` `a debt at 24 months, known`
#ASSERT NOT `the partner is personally liable for the debt under section 28` `a debt at 30 months by a non-partner`

